  "__comment": "The starter blueprints (doc 273): the same format as a player's blueprint file, read by BlueprintLibrary. Only materials workers can build. A log is \"log:<wood>:<direction>\" (doc 275). Cells sit relative to the corner; R turns them when placed. \"refusals\" says why a file in the player's folder was not read, one sentence a refusal code (BlueprintLibrary.parse gives the code and the fields).",
